      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The clinical features of forming of komorbydnoho combination of vegetative disfunction are studied with the displays of chronic pain. It examined 82 adolescents--48 girls (58.5%) and 34 boys (41.5%) aged 16-17 years. All teenagers have noted the presence of the dual problems of stress in their lives. Girls feel a greater impact of stressful factors than boys. The largest number of connected stressful factors were found in the subgroup of women with the syndrome tsefalhiyi, and the lowest was observed among boys with abdominalhiyi syndrome."},
